{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026gJ316xPKpv1793234908.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>百威亞太截至九月底止第三季度按年少賺五成，純利9,200萬美元。正常化EBITDA逾3.2億美元，倒退兩成六，內生性衰減百分之22.9。</p><p></p><p>期內收入跌近百分之7，內生性衰減百分之8.4，接近14.5億美元。總銷量減少百分之10.1，主要受中國市場表現影響，但被印度的增長所部分抵銷。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T01:41:13.957562+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T00:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T04:18:15.761995+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T01:38:13.993189+00:00","content_hash":"e71d394a1228dee0beb036e05343e88be2073b63d28a70c835622c53ad3b0aa7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T01:41:13.957562+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}